	TAD	MVCDF		/MAKE INTO CDF INSTRUCTION
	DCA	FLDINST		/STORE IN-LINE
FLDINST,.-.			/GOTO APPROPRIATE DATA FIELD
GETOUT,	ISZ	GETADR		/BUMP PAST ARGUMENT
